  "shortDescription": "Manage passwords and OTP workflows faster with a secure, offline Windows credential vault.\n",
  "description": "Stop wasting time copying passwords and OTP codes separately.\n\nOTP Password Manager is a simple, fast, and secure Windows app for storing your login credentials locally and copying passwords with manual OTP support when you need them.\nDesigned for users who want a lightweight password tool without cloud sync, accounts, subscriptions, or unnecessary complexity.\nWith OTP Password Manager, you can keep your credentials organized, search them quickly, copy usernames and passwords, and append manually entered OTP codes when required.\nYour data stays on your Windows device. Credentials are stored locally and protected using Windows security technology.",
